.580" end="00:47.970">Move </span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.660">along</span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:48.660">, </span><span begin="00:48.660" end="00:49.080">move </span><span begin="00:49.080" end="00:49.680">along </span><span begin="00:49.680" end="00:50.160">like </span><span begin="00:50.160" end="00:50.340">I </span><span begin="00:50.340" end="00:50.670">know </span><span begin="00:50.670" end="00:51.060">you </span><span begin="00:51.060" end="00:52.020">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.340" end="00:56.250"><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.640">And </span><span begin="00:53.640" end="00:54.150">even </span><span begin="00:54.150" end="00:54.450">when </span><span begin="00:54.450" end="00:54.690">your </span><span begin="00:54.690" end="00:55.170">hope </span><span begin="00:55.170" end="00:55.500">is </span><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:56.250">gone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.250" end="01:03.240"><span begin="00:56.250" end="00:56.700">Move </span><span begin="00:56.700" end="00:57.390">along</span><span begin="00:57.390" end="00:57.390">, </span><span begin="00:57.390" end="00:57.780">move </span><span begin="00:57.780" end="00:58.470">along </span><span begin="00:58.470" end="00:58.860">just </span><span begin="00:58.860" end="00:59.040">to </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.550">make </span><span begin="00:59.550" end="00:59.760">it </span><span begin="00:59.760" end="01:00.390">through</span><span begin="01:00.390" end="01:00.390">,</span><span begin="01:00.390" end="01:00.840">move </span><span begin="01:00.840" end="01:03.240">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.710" end="01:06.180"><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:05.190">Move </span><span begin="01:05.190" end="01:06.180">along</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.290" end="01:15.180"><span begin="01:10.290" end="01:10.950">So </span><span begin="01:10.950" end="01:11.070">a </span><span begin="01:11.070" end="01:11.430">day </span><